  <data name="vortexTag1.ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>As of October 15th, 2026, Potato Graphics has not been observed 
to cause game instability, crashes, or account restrictions. However, Epic Games 
can change Fortnite's game files and Anti-Cheat with each update, 
which may affect how this tweak works.

Use this tweak at your own risk and check for compatibility after major Fortnite updates.</value>
